{{Item|Wither Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in the [[Catacombs]].

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Wither Essence}} can be be obtained in the {{Zone|dungeon hub}} and the [[Catacombs]] in multiple ways:
* [[Dungeon Reward Chest]]s
* [[Dungeon Secrets]]
* [[Dungeon Hub Race]] reward from {{NPCSprite|Guildford}}.
* [[Salvaging#Wither|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Wither Essence}}.
